 <html><body>Adventurers' Guide:<br>
-You had a long journey, hadn't you? I'm sure you are tired.<br>
-I help everybody who fights evil!<br>
-Thanks to the warriors such as yourself, our villagers could survive despite of all the darkness that had surrounded us.<br>
-If you have unnecessary things that can be donated, I will give you high level buffs in exchange.<br>
-<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass Script AdventurersGuide guide-01.html"><font color="LEVEL">List of the buffs for characters of Lv. 1-99</font></Button>
-<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass Script AdventurersGuide guide-02.html"><font color="LEVEL">List of the donation buffs</font></Button>
+Greetings, traveler! How may I be of assistance?<br>
+My job is to offer what little assistance I can as you charge into all this endless intense fighting!<br>
+Even now, the monster attacks on this village grow stronger each day; it is only due to your tireless efforts that we have remained safe this long.<br>
+I can sell you <font color="LEVEL">Special Cocktail</font>, if you want. It will help you defeat the monsters.<br>
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass Script AdventurersGuide guide-01.html"><font color="LEVEL">Buffs for characters below Lv. 105</font></Button>
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass Script AdventurersGuide guide-09.html"><font color="LEVEL">Ask about Special Cocktail</font></Button>
 <Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass -h Script AdventurersGuide weakenBreath">Weaken Shilen's Breath Lv. 3 or higher</Button>
 </body></html>
