@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+<html><body>Adventurers' Guide:<br>
+You want to buy a Special Cocktail?<br>
+It costs <font color="LEVEL">500,000 adena</font> and grants you the same buff that I provide, but you can use it whenever you want.<br>
+In other words, you wouldn't have to return to me whenever you need a pick-me-up.<br>
+What's more, Special Cocktail has no minimum level requirements and can be sold to other characters.<br>
+So, what do you think?<br>
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass -h npc_%objectId%_multisell 323270001">Buy a Special Cocktail</Button>
+</body></html>
